 ],
 "description": "The BENETEAU First SE range builds on the legendary racing heritage of the FIRST, infused with Seascape DNA. It thrives through a passionate community of sailors who seek adventure, embrace nature, and push beyond their limits.\nMeet the newest member of the First SE range: the First 36 SE (Seascape Edition).\nDesigned for ultimate high-speed sailing experience she is a pure planning racer while being optimized for competitive ORC racing.\nThe First 36 SE is a game-changer for those who love high-performance sailing.\nWhether you’re looking to push the limits in ORC racing or simply experience the pure joy of planing, this boat delivers in every way.",
