 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "text-images-slider",
   "id": "SAILING EXPERIENCE",
   "title": "SAILING EXPERIENCE",
   "intro": "The First 36 SE is designed to provide an unparalleled connection to the ancient art of sailing. Every element has been fine-tuned to transform wind into pure sailing joy.\nTo enhance responsiveness, we replaced steering wheels with a tiller, added soft, non-skid technical foam in the cockpit, and reduced weight by an additional 400 kg (881 pounds). The hull has also been refined, decreasing wetted surface area by nearly 3 m² (32,3 square foot). The result? Arguably the fastest and most exhilarating 36-ft production boat on the market.",
